= The Chancellor Resigns!

Chancellor **Hollweg** resigns after his support for equal suffrage, and ending the Great War without a negotiated peace led him into conflict with some of the major conservative parties (DKP, NLP, FKP).

Both Erich Ludendorff and Paul von Hindenburg threaten to resign, and Hollweg, wanting to save himself and the Emperor from the embarrassment, chooses to resign.

Georg Michaelis has ascended to the position and will be the next chancellor. He supports ending the war with annexations and is against equal suffrage.